    "dozen": {
      "word": "DOZEN",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "A collection of twelve objects; a tale or set of twelve; with or without of before the substantive which follows. \"Some six or seven dozen of Scots.\" \"A dozen of shirts to your back.\" \"A dozen sons.\" \"Half a dozen friends.\" Shak.",
